<title>UK: BOE gives money mkt 350 mln stg assistance.</title>
<headline>BOE gives money mkt 350 mln stg assistance.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of England said that it provided the UK money market with 350 million stg of assistance.</p>
<p>It bought 318 million stg in a fixed rate repo at 6.0 percent and 32 million stg of bills outright.</p>
<p>The repos will run to March 17 and 18 and the bills mature on or before March 18.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom 44 171 542 2774</p>
</text>
